{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "4d1ad8e711006c6365f32370d58d510009206c26471a584786d27883d2a63755", "ja": "明日に繋ぐfriendship", "zh": "连系明日的friendship", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c88bd981ac918328bcb11d7df6fc596bc3119f05ce5f82964fa968298b18fd76", "ja": "小生意気なバスケ娘こと『アオ』と\n出会った真美。メンバーも合流し、一緒に\nバスケを教わることになる。練習や遊びを\n通して親交を深める中、アオは真美たちが\nアイドルであることを知る。", "zh": "真美遇到了有点狂妄的篮球少女“碧”。\n其他成员也一同汇合，大家一起向她\n学习打篮球。在练习与玩耍中逐渐加深\n交情的过程中，碧得知了真美等人\n其实是偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "7f8bbb5bc249de0ac12a5f84753aa5f143f67d79048178d3496e692f9da518b2", "ja": "1時間後……", "zh": "一个小时后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6293973db14f0deaf7149593f97ec4600d36626a3193e2899f6ea779a60f2ca1", "ja": "……で、アタシたちが様子を見に来るまで\nずーっと1on1して、ボロ負けしたんだ？", "zh": "……所以，直到我们过来看看情况之前，\n你们就一直在1on1，结果惨败了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "056874a9935c0baddcc7f2d08574eb59de9537ef3f1dd295599256b95caa6699", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……。ぼ、ボロ負けじゃないもん！\nほら、バスケ娘も、へ、ヘロヘロっしょ！？", "zh": "哈、哈、哈……才、才不是惨败呢！\n你看，那个篮球姑娘也累得够呛吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1003_ao", "source_sha256": "31a329e6bec94b8a0b8a3724630deee3286d347534444adfd2c3132928051703", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……。そりゃ、時間無制限で、\n100点以上の、ゲームなんて、したことないし……。", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊，哈啊……那当然，我从没玩过时间不限、得分要达到100分以上的游戏……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "6c5da04c6f6f3aafa3b4ad5f4b18653a48568763e2859f96a4689fec7680ca7a", "ja": "「100点以上対0点」って、スゴイスコアだよネ♪\n100まで数えるのも大変だったでショ？", "zh": "“100分以上对0分”，真是好厉害的比分呢♪\n光是数到100也很不容易吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "e92342a72ccbc2d05f0570475619d4022969a802ac235c2810a4e021b853d46b", "ja": "なんかごめんね、うちの真美が迷惑かけて。\n無理やり勝負させられたんじゃない？", "zh": "总觉得有点对不起，让我们家的真美给你添麻烦了。你不是被她硬拉着比试了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1006_ao", "source_sha256": "dc254135e5bff223431d9f1fe60ce3524027a77c55194d89fa9d0158644083de", "ja": "え、うん……。わかるんだ？", "zh": "诶，嗯……你明白啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "7bcc92cb252651428967c4ac83ddb1be0e4df35a9f30d03608b77d9715ca3eb7", "ja": "あはは、やっぱり。真美、ダメじゃないか。\n実力差を無視して無理やり付き合わせて。", "zh": "啊哈哈，果然。真美，你这样可不行啊。\n无视实力差距，硬拉着人家陪你比。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "8b7b65d40d67aba97094d61c81539e1d8ad732b647c44432513b28a90bd41970", "ja": "も、もうちょいで入るシュートもあったんだよ～。\nはぁ……世界の壁は高かった～……。", "zh": "差、差一点就能投进的球也是有的啦～。\n唉……世界的高墙还是太难跨越了～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "9b8a822cafc2b85ad38d09ee065b12aba061b6cad7776a1304b0993f59b642de", "ja": "世界？", "zh": "世界？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0530ff78d2edc76a29585239cc85b1200841f510662a9fbd12ccfb88b4c9a191", "ja": "とにかくごめんっ！　真美には後でまた、\nよく言っとくから。え～っと……？", "zh": "总之对不起！我之后会再好好说说真美的。呃——……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1011_ao", "source_sha256": "beb9561c5fcde9a2da843bf6de418c1eb5b7cb7726e5553bfc7b2dbd7829254d", "ja": "あ、アオっていいます。", "zh": "啊，我叫阿青。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "19130e69b68ffde253ee099a70ed0574a91a61881e2cc43e7a41436876ca28e3", "ja": "アオか、よろしく！\nアタシは、えーっと、歩。そしてこっちが。", "zh": "阿青啊，请多关照！\n我嘛，呃……叫步。然后这边是——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "6e08dd015c5576eb1e6b966133296cbc1e67869c04e2b775c8fe1d9258060372", "ja": "真です！　よろしくね！", "zh": "我是小真！请多关照哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "c49a38afe561cce96dddb3ae3918dbf4d91c6ac44bc6a5224c14d0c31671175a", "ja": "ハーイ！　エレナだよ、アオー♪", "zh": "嗨！我是艾蕾娜，阿奥～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "830b6286e1fdf7b073337d05bc23ecf0358c9736e6330638910b6f0a4568f43c", "ja": "真美はもう覚えたっしょ？　バスケ娘、そんな名前\nだったんだ。……んじゃ、アオぽんね！　よろよろ～♪", "zh": "真美已经记住了吧？那个篮球女孩，原来是叫这个名字啊。……那就叫你阿奥彭吧！请多关照啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1016_ao", "source_sha256": "e70c9136af7a64be8865b9010ea2e0402019afcdb04c572c9a29d3dd3d6dbe01", "ja": "ア、アオぽん……？", "zh": "啊、阿葵……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "3bca7ad6771be9b423bea3d5cf2a9b8e14dd941476c1b1ab0f401f5b8889f829", "ja": "ってことで！　心臓もバクバクいわなく\nなってきたし、リターンマッチといこうかアオぽん！", "zh": "所以说！心脏也渐渐没那么怦怦跳了，来场复赛吧，阿欧朋！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1018_ao", "source_sha256": "32232224bc5a498999c48e38307b6d904a9c6cd0b12ced93e3a1b97a994787d0", "ja": "はぁ？　だから歴が違うし、アンタじゃ勝てないって。\nウチ赤ん坊の頃からバスケやってるし。", "zh": "哈？都说了，我们的资历不一样，你赢不了我的。\n我可是从还是婴儿的时候就开始打篮球了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "e00fe883ab146ab630052e5f4b715cee4a730512b171b3cd23aacef36b39e9cb", "ja": "え、そんなに？　もしかして、\nバスケにめちゃくちゃ詳しいとか？", "zh": "诶，有这么夸张吗？难道说，你对篮球特别了解？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1020_ao", "source_sha256": "336c6e43463cdab9018d922fd35d3fe1ab3a4257426245e5e7e48f42e7e6a71b", "ja": "別にフツーだけど……。まぁ学校だったら、\n腕も知識もウチに敵うヤツはいないかな。フフン♪", "zh": "没什么特别的，挺普通的……不过要是在学校里，论本事和知识，应该没人能赢过我吧。哼哼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1021_012mam", "source_sha256": "ed4afa3928c4f30ab3da3598db0aac72a0578edf17f24f87165c254514ccf658", "ja": "んじゃ他のコトで！　今度は真美のフィールドで\n勝負してもらうかんね！", "zh": "那就换个项目！这次来在真美的领域一决胜负吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "edce692a7a3991516c18c4c978fdfe84a7b92395cf889f3d075b0e4a7bbc54ac", "ja": "ストップ真美！　自分の目的忘れてない？\nバスケ、上手くなりたかったんでしょ？", "zh": "等等，真美！你没忘记自己的目的吧？\n你不是想把篮球练得更好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1023_012mam", "source_sha256": "b6baa0124f93e47ee0df854d4299c281aedec7620656cee9e1754f59e0d0c44f", "ja": "ん？　……あ、そうだった！", "zh": "嗯？……啊，对哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1024_018ele", "source_sha256": "4e17de4af764fe7d9d5ee13f2ec402c6f2be832015232bf364a92df4e695eb38", "ja": "そうだヨ～！　真美も、ついでにワタシたちも！\nアオにバスケ教えてもらったらいいんじゃないかナ？", "zh": "没错哟～！真美也顺便教教我们吧！\n让阿岚教我们打篮球，不是挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1025_ao", "source_sha256": "d58b4474ea83d76f3fe45aed41bd22d0f26219c408d4be4d680b9ae499da66c5", "ja": "……は？", "zh": "……什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1026_006mak", "source_sha256": "48e869d03736ddd8128b113ff9f543d05796dc16aafe9cef8ebd01da8af6018a", "ja": "あ、突然ごめんねアオ。その……ボク達、急にバスケに\n目覚めてさ。詳しい人に教わろうって思ってたんだ。", "zh": "啊，突然这么说不好意思，阿欧。那个……我们突然对篮球产生了兴趣。所以想着找个懂行的人教教我们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1027_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f8c32b24965486c167d4c61a8ff97d1af9d4b3d6c93d47fe4067e12f13601048", "ja": "もしアオさえよかったら、アタシ達にいろいろ教えて\nくれない？　ホント、よかったらでいいんだけど！", "zh": "要是小碧你不介意的话，能不能教教我们各种技巧？真的，要你方便才行啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1028_ao", "source_sha256": "8ed4d1019799559a4c7d7902f67e369ff70c32ccc4f50185efcab0b9a1822112", "ja": "ふ～ん……。ま、ウチで良ければ別にいいよ。\nなんかお姉さんたち、悪い人じゃなさそうだし。", "zh": "嗯……。嘛，要是我没问题的话，倒也可以。\n感觉那些姐姐们好像也不是什么坏人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1029_018ele", "source_sha256": "65a88f2e52cc45d442adc9fb5a3ab4baea43cdb2ab3438651540998a4352e73c", "ja": "ホント！？　ワーイ！　やったネ～♪\nありがと、アオ！", "zh": "真的！？太好了！成功啦～♪\n谢谢你，Ao！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1030_006mak", "source_sha256": "a4ff968534691c9663cd1ab6c792a0077f9994b98247d693e55cdda332a56c3b", "ja": "お姉さん……！", "zh": "姐姐……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1031_ao", "source_sha256": "424e8e8ecf1b21f30ec39833215239210a3bc79f739278cc169faeb9c7e11708", "ja": "ウチ、どうせヒマしてるしね。\n毎日ここで一日中バスケしてるだけだから。", "zh": "我反正也没什么事嘛。\n每天只是在这里打上一整天篮球而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1032_006mak", "source_sha256": "ee5ff18675585bf04df05e4e69e022795aab4ece12d4582712d205b93a42106f", "ja": "？　一日中って……。", "zh": "？一整天……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1033_ao", "source_sha256": "fa1d9d3d24feb2f03d7d2db07ded9ac4dc113793d8bac936b4bef5a3a2357b59", "ja": "ん、ウチ学校行ってないから。……あ、別にフクザツな\n事情とかも全然無いから、気にしないで。", "zh": "嗯，我没去上学。……啊，也完全没有什么复杂的原因，所以不用在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1034_ao", "source_sha256": "d9e6f9a481e7371a48514b2d1a5388a31811017e4ffa20f7c3f051b17ada4775", "ja": "なんか、学校のみんなは子供っぽいっていうか？\nクラス変わって、ますます合わんくて。それだけだし。", "zh": "总觉得，学校里的大家有点孩子气，怎么说呢？换了班以后，就更合不来了。也就这样而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1035_018ele", "source_sha256": "dcd196e60270ec1f7e4f4148797f5737ede6d092e5480c3214cd93b5ecf123d1", "ja": "そっかぁ……残念だネ。でもワタシたちは、\nすぐわかったヨ？　アオはいい子だって！", "zh": "这样啊……真遗憾呢。不过我们可是马上就看出来了哦？アオ是个好孩子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1036_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d177a26e0faaa5f02a2bfc0e49186fdff5d0a1b65b772c9b8392cd300d62468c", "ja": "そうそう、こうみえてアタシ達も、いろいろある方\nだからさ。お互い気にしないでいこっか！", "zh": "对对，别看我们这样，其实也经历过不少事情。所以，彼此就别放在心上啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1037_ao", "source_sha256": "0b8ca6ef0033831beb7ff531ef125714afdca3b9b3a9316533a33b6b693d02f3", "ja": "……うん。そんな感じで。", "zh": "……嗯。就按这个感觉来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1038_012mam", "source_sha256": "d5192b7dab79115a3dd8537bfcb0b4d3ad8ba58f84d52395d9f3aaa59640351a", "ja": "うんうん、これからは真美が友達になってあげよう！\nんで、明日からのアオぽんの毎日を忙しくしてあげる♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，以后就由真美来当你的朋友吧！\n然后，从明天开始，就让小葵的每一天都变得忙忙碌碌的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1039_ao", "source_sha256": "6e862357440f5ff68bbd78826019a441324d37fbc6ff66e2f369ab6758c43574", "ja": "なにそれ、迷惑。\nじゃあマミだけバスケ教えない。", "zh": "那是什么啊，真烦人。那我就不教真美打篮球了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1040_012mam", "source_sha256": "4505e6f139a0765aae75db667955b092d350bba48983d24c6ed6105530bac569", "ja": "ええっ、なにそれヒドクない！？\nさては真美のサイノーに恐怖したね？", "zh": "诶——什么嘛，也太过分了吧！？\n你该不会是被真美的才能吓到了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1041_ao", "source_sha256": "6e458f88283161fe43f1d354f1951bd1546675b6389f5171fd441992f817a9a5", "ja": "するわけないし！　まともにドリブルできるように\nなってから出直してくれる？", "zh": "才不会做呢！等你能像样地运球了，再回来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1042_012mam", "source_sha256": "8ca407285f7d6d67aec2bd1c88c516d15221ac31132ae15fa871cd973f7fb817", "ja": "全然できるもんねー！　ついて来な、\n今見せてやんよ！　とりゃーーっ！！", "zh": "我当然完全没问题啦——！跟上来，让你现在就见识一下！喝啊——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1043_ao", "source_sha256": "37f913dedcaa80840ada98c6fb84da4563a23cd681553b80aec814c0292e7f38", "ja": "ちょ、マミ、引っ張るなし！", "zh": "喂，真美，别拉啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1044_006mak", "source_sha256": "2f0a351571eb291c62b20ff11ee141657498cdf342cd3c098a3969560cff452d", "ja": "あ、真美～、もう帰るんだからね～。\n今日はそれで最後にしなよ～！", "zh": "啊，真美～，我们要回去了～。\n今天就到此为止吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1045_018ele", "source_sha256": "ea36e36b56b02ff35266ee2373c4646ed3add5edb92e9242ec4609cd5b277d02", "ja": "そうそう、続きはまた明日、だからネ～！", "zh": "对对，剩下的明天再继续，所以呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1046_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d5e38d68bc1b7918d0a091dd452fa53787988fb2b35f4248979830871ff6efc8", "ja": "また明日、か……。\n小さい頃は、毎日言ってた気がするな～。", "zh": "明天见啊……\n感觉小时候每天都会说呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1047_006mak", "source_sha256": "eacd43a66efabb4dbb1cc61c0b343cb7fdf287e0821690209b2613109388aa73", "ja": "ははっ、そうだね。大人に近づくほど、\n言わなくなっていくのかな。また明日、って。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。越长大，反而越不常说了吧。“明天见”什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1048_018ele", "source_sha256": "ff3956a7eb9b12a665785eab6510389dcf6f778673f87bff38c93c4856e7e4d8", "ja": "ウーン……。\nもしかすると～……。", "zh": "唔……。\n说不定～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1049_018ele", "source_sha256": "783b1a9ef8ac70bbca0dcce17aa06fcf8d2edc5796eb4db572d671b8fb54b356", "ja": "明日がキラキラしてるほど、\n言いたくなるんじゃないかナ……♪", "zh": "越是觉得明天闪闪发光，就越想说出来吧……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1050_null", "source_sha256": "8eb3a17ce6572b2f1d5853f9bb39a5e9ef918ef2ad62dbc585f166f728ebede9", "ja": "その後のある日……", "zh": "之后的某一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1051_012mam", "source_sha256": "464aba525e1427b42385e484980e9bc1e29b5355982f4234dafd6a02fb863798", "ja": "アオぽん、メンコ持ってきたよー！\n今日はこれで決着つけるかんね！", "zh": "阿青，我把拍画片带来了——！\n今天就用这个一决胜负吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1052_006mak", "source_sha256": "495b1bc4b548a30dc824b058da83e165221b84f08bfa35be041629c550eda0aa", "ja": "違う違う！　今日からアオにバスケを\n教わりに来たんでしょ！", "zh": "不对不对！你今天不是来让阿青教你打篮球的吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1053_012mam", "source_sha256": "3cc30f40c419bbb35a15ac1f66ff7341a622ce0cf55d37765472f64a0b0c1bd2", "ja": "もー、まこちんせっかちだなぁ。わかってるって！\nメンコ対決はバスケの後に決まってるっしょ？", "zh": "真是的，真哥太心急啦。我知道啦！\n拍洋画对决肯定是要排在打篮球之后嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1054_ao", "source_sha256": "df598f195e7ffabe632be2fa4e1d49cc16a77a3a54223436be6745355653b257", "ja": "決まってたんだ……ま、いいけど。\nどうせ、それもウチが勝つし。", "zh": "原来已经决定好了啊……嘛，也行吧。  \n反正那个也是我赢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1055_012mam", "source_sha256": "a519a1a7a244575cf3d6ac70644f7d8517fb598f2eec633510072d0022b4866a", "ja": "メンコの勝負は、バスケの実力で決まらないことを教え\nてやんよ！　その前に、まずバスケを教わってやんよ！", "zh": "我来教你，拍洋画的胜负可不是由篮球实力决定的！在那之前，先让你教我打篮球！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1056_ao", "source_sha256": "62e7a575ea9e0d920f699cd64ee543ea4a4e5fb980149712e933524602633d11", "ja": "……教わる態度じゃなくない？", "zh": "……这可不是请教别人该有的态度吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1057_null", "source_sha256": "c230be38d087b0a9cecec3d43402d70a312eb0d554cc9153544b27d2d5fd7c8b", "ja": "その後の別のある日……（の、バスケ練習後）", "zh": "之后的某一天……（篮球练习结束后）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1058_012mam", "source_sha256": "bd5e7a0ca0f9b0348dc467a859ed909d6785a3bac747c78164293373051e9dac", "ja": "アオぽん！　勝ち逃げは許さないかんね！　今日は\nやったことないって言ってたベーゴマで勝負だー！", "zh": "小葵！不许赢了就跑啊！今天就用你说过没玩过的陀螺来一决胜负——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1059_018ele", "source_sha256": "19192ac49623862e1b12d6b1e60d91a54a512b383494b1937440ae4924458722", "ja": "ワオ！　マミ、言ってることがズルすぎて\n気持ちいいくらいだヨ～♪", "zh": "哇！真美，你说的话也太耍赖了，简直让人痛快呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1060_ao", "source_sha256": "7380ba908021d4114b916113e3ffeb641de6082fceb74041691840d836bf609b", "ja": "いいよ、ハンデあげるくらいで、\nマミにはちょうどいいし。……フフン♪", "zh": "没问题，给你点让步，\n对真美来说才刚刚好呢。……哼哼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1061_null", "source_sha256": "7aa2af7db961a0567b2f15cb010df2a1495541a2f38792de371336b65d20e1c4", "ja": "またまた別のある日……（の、バスケ練習後）", "zh": "又是另一天……（篮球训练后）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1062_012mam", "source_sha256": "fc9fce85c5d52061efbd29bfe094fa82546771c84806d8eed6e2a2430a50d420", "ja": "アオぽん、今日はピコモンね♪　ゲーム持ってなくても\n大丈夫！　亜美の持ってきたから！", "zh": "阿青，今天玩《皮可兽》吧♪　就算没带游戏也没关系！亚美带来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1063_034ayu", "source_sha256": "811f151240dc1262644d3d68586b6c0f5d0f44fae5886dd5289c1d40d09baae5", "ja": "それもう亜美との対決じゃない……？", "zh": "那已经不算是和亚美对决了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1064_ao", "source_sha256": "6f1748ef5191405b487550dede9e3d669d26ce2c4e17f8510eaa19914a7d138c", "ja": "ゲームは……ほとんどやったことない……。\nなにこれ。ボタン押せばいいの？", "zh": "游戏……几乎没怎么玩过……。\n这是什么？按按钮就行了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1065_012mam", "source_sha256": "c51992af9507267f05f572e0bc80ba96f3c5d661c3f1f006948879199a91aee6", "ja": "しょうがないなぁ。とりあえず真美のオススメ編成教え\nたげるけど、その代わり真美もガチ編成でいくかんね！", "zh": "真拿你没办法。总之先告诉你真美推荐的编队，  \n不过作为交换，真美也要用认真编队上场哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1066_ao", "source_sha256": "af11604befb7bdff257b36698eb3ad7c7363b797713ef10a3de52595a4f72e20", "ja": "あれ、勝った。", "zh": "哎，赢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1067_012mam", "source_sha256": "feed5a8e5a9ba875cdfde567f0ac2269748e0efe872bc2b3b58fe40bcb1ad9e4", "ja": "なんでーっ！？　くやし～初心者に負けた～。\nこっちはSSRも入れてたのに～！！", "zh": "为什么啊——！？好不甘心～居然输给了新手～。\n我这边明明还放了SSR啊～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1068_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4e786be210771f181e67bedec21c70d15a7f1c10a10717d97586b92f4377af3f", "ja": "あははっ、油断してたんじゃない？\nさ、今日はそろそろ帰ろっか。", "zh": "啊哈哈，你是不是大意了？\n好啦，今天差不多该回去咯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1069_012mam", "source_sha256": "9e11d4a4737bd2b060c946a40356c9acf86de380835966e0a06d508024bd22e3", "ja": "納得できない。アオぽん、ピコモンは明日もっかいね！\n絶対だかんね！　んじゃ、また明日ね～♪", "zh": "我不服。阿欧、皮可萌，明天再来一次！说好了哦！那，明天见啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1070_ao", "source_sha256": "173fefe6043b48a8ea3817e7e6dd77b07f01db608c19241309a1f2db24da21f2", "ja": "フフン、懲りないヤツ。\nいいよ、じゃ……また明日。", "zh": "哼，真是不长记性。\n好吧，那就……明天见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1071_null", "source_sha256": "2f0d954f08920dd1d4796dfba8836ac30a3f4c33f59a11bcc6010106485f9273", "ja": "そのまた別のある日……", "zh": "又是另外的某一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1072_034ayu", "source_sha256": "00738a711f974a27b2be2b5111a6f868c603e13e6d60dfa03c77ad456239a9be", "ja": "お疲れ、アオ！　今日は真もエレナも、\n用事で来れなくなっちゃったんだ。ゴメン！", "zh": "辛苦了，阿步！今天真和艾莉娜也因为有事来不了了。抱歉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1073_ao", "source_sha256": "a09a70225ff94dba099519e30828923ff22e92034da9efb00ee79f37f0af414d", "ja": "え、そなんだ……。じゃあ、いつもみたく\n2on2できないね。1on1にする？", "zh": "诶，是这样啊……。那就不能像平时那样设为2on2了。要改成1on1吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1074_012mam", "source_sha256": "994e04a77f6425bd579938dc7ac5401e1536ebaf3b92615daf7d67c161da519c", "ja": "大丈夫！　代わりに真美のコネで、\nバスケ三人衆を連れてきたのだよ。カモーン！", "zh": "没问题！真美动用人脉，\n把篮球三人组给带来了哦。Come on！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1075_014mir", "source_sha256": "b2f50174b47bca09b07be39ea9852d88e3d17fbce3dc964712e3ebe1c4ff0076", "ja": "春日未来、14歳！\nバスケは部活の助っ人したことあるから大丈夫！", "zh": "春日未来，14岁！\n篮球嘛，我帮过社团打过替补，没问题的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1076_040tam", "source_sha256": "aa9e66731de6beeaba6398df07d53b4936c7364e7f0b276944e9b00ac21b7c4d", "ja": "たまきだぞー！\nバスケはけっこうトクイなんだ♪　くふふ♪", "zh": "是环哦——！\n我可是很擅长篮球的♪　嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1077_043nor", "source_sha256": "3951affe6984ec2d08a493cfce33d09119246c208ca4aa07589b57d1c50ffc33", "ja": "はじめまして、アタシはのり子！　いつもここで\nバスケしてるって聞いて、ついてきたよ！", "zh": "初次见面，我是则子！听说你一直在这里打篮球，我就跟过来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1078_012mam", "source_sha256": "02fae7308b750bc70d7cf3e48a01196d326557e28e7d6e99db1c6731f1991e84", "ja": "ま、じつは劇場にいたメンバーを\n連れてきただけなんだけど♪", "zh": "不过，其实只是把剧场里的成员带过来了而已♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1079_ao", "source_sha256": "83a30eb44dba4e36d789fbd5851a5daa60723bdea5690e3bd1c73a171019c93c", "ja": "劇場？　……ふーん？", "zh": "剧场？……哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1080_012mam", "source_sha256": "903e2024187b41b13882fbc335912ee949e8a0c58b5243c01cc36b40df9b9298", "ja": "あれ？　そういえばアオぽんに話してなかったっけ？\n真美たちって、近くの劇場にいるアイドルなんだ～。", "zh": "咦？这么说来，我还没跟阿青说过吧？\n真美她们是附近剧场里的偶像哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1081_ao", "source_sha256": "b50e7c80bb08daf655d8e468a43e7b7cbc24377996b44be12d1c8a70683401db", "ja": "は？　アイドル？　マミが？\n……え、みんな？　なにそのヘンな……冗談……。", "zh": "哈？偶像？真美我？\n……诶，大家？你们开什么奇怪的……玩笑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1082_ao", "source_sha256": "33313f8d5bba337eeecd734f88f8b8c16d8d5f2f984442d4434639a51928bb34", "ja": "え、マジメに？　うそ！？", "zh": "诶，认真的吗？骗人的吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1083_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b24dbef793cd88a76f03d50a95e5aa3894e3882fc7794ca0d6c1358277d33f5f", "ja": "あー、じつはマジなんだ、アオ。\nなんか内緒にしてたみたいでゴメン！", "zh": "啊——其实是真的啦，阿葵。\n感觉像故意瞒着你一样，对不起啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1084_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9ac8d7607718df572357d7a4bcd41ce764a9d5c55309b74f7c560f33ac7ba4a4", "ja": "アイドルのこと、あんまり知らないみたいだし、\nわざわざ言うことでもないと思って。", "zh": "你好像不太了解偶像这回事，\n所以我觉得没必要特意告诉你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1085_014mir", "source_sha256": "f7f8a07ff999713a0bb5f4918da56f57137ad5613e3f8e638e2bca3802e2f362", "ja": "そっか、アオちゃん知らなかったんだ？　じゃあ\n改めて……春日未来、14歳！　アイドルやってます♪", "zh": "这样啊，小青原来不知道呀？那就重新介绍一下……春日未来，14岁！我是一名偶像♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1086_ao", "source_sha256": "da9763a95bd6dea2a8fb6c8483bed238e24589e09195974fb99faf086a60d527", "ja": "いやもうわかったけど……\nへえ、アイドルだったんだ……。ふーん……。", "zh": "哎呀，我已经知道了……  \n哦，原来是偶像啊……嗯……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1087_040tam", "source_sha256": "66d0bbdf671cdcd83dde263bdbf9d91b6cae332d93b357422120040d53f70cc7", "ja": "あ！　もしかして、アオもアイドルになりたい？\n劇場で一緒にアイドルする？", "zh": "啊！莫非碧也想成为偶像吗？\n要不要在剧场一起当偶像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1088_ao", "source_sha256": "464e624bbedc6b0f0e69b5e59c4ac65c35dcfb3fe1aed67e57c2a089b6fac3f6", "ja": "し、しないしない！　なりたいとか全然ないし！\nちょっとビックリしてただけ！", "zh": "才、才不要呢！我完全没有想成为那样的人！只是稍微吓了一跳而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1089_ao", "source_sha256": "a82b55b898a3c53c5b11e3c4d458980f49158ad8b91eae31b0aea7a74758f936", "ja": "だって、ゲーノージンってことだし。\nそんなんフツーに驚くし……。", "zh": "毕竟，那可是艺人嘛。  \n那种事，当然会让人惊讶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1090_ao", "source_sha256": "337d8bdd77fa09cf7105cacfe89c09b50b528abed6224ef78a25b0c19520c109", "ja": "でも、なんか納得した。そっか。\nやっぱ……住む世界、違うんだ。", "zh": "不过，总觉得能理解了。原来如此。\n果然……我们生活在不同的世界。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1091_034ayu", "source_sha256": "452aa74bdaf9afc89f9fe28dea48798507a06f02e4071a94c54bc0a121c62551", "ja": "？　アオ？", "zh": "？阿欧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1092_043nor", "source_sha256": "8dd37a2c195787f564c42f813ee45abf6bf10b94f53723b9e570de08d9853112", "ja": "そういえば真美、こないだテレビ出てたよね？\nそれも見なかった？", "zh": "对了，真美前阵子上电视了吧？\n那个你也没看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1093_ao", "source_sha256": "c741724153364f55f915affba465195d6fb1000d28babc9a6c33e08dad5c754e", "ja": "あー、うん。ウチ、あんまテレビとか見てないし。\n動画は見るけど。", "zh": "啊——嗯，我平时不太看电视之类的。\n不过会看视频。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_03_1094_012mam", "source_sha256": "8ffaf338a4f97fb443a583d6ef22c8cc6d5e17ac7b10d8d2bc02f0ad64a3dba7", "ja": "あ、そうだ！！　じゃあさじゃあさ、\n今日はここでバスケでいいんだけど、今度はさ～！", "zh": "啊，对了！！那这样那这样，\n今天在这里打篮球就行，不过下次嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
